{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776480/extras/Banner-Discord.jpg?t=1759963496\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This demo is an early build that includes about 2 hours of gameplay. Let us know your thoughts!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything Has Two Sides</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Paraside: Duality Unbound, your experience revolves around mastering Duality Manipulation, a unique mechanic that intertwines directly with your role as the leader of Earth's last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776480/extras/EHTS-00.gif?t=1759963496\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with tactical missions against extraplanar threats, this core mechanic is introduced as you command a team navigating a world torn between two realities. Your decisions in these missions serve as your first foray into leveraging the dual nature of the universe.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is <strong>double-sided</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters <strong>act simultaneously</strong> on both sides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can observe both sides and wield powers to <strong>swap space</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776480/extras/EHTS-1.gif?t=1759963496\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776480/extras/EHTS-2.gif?t=1759963496\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776480/extras/EHTS-3.gif?t=1759963496\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you delve deeper into the game, the concept of Duality Manipulation expands, offering innovative ways to influence the environment and story. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Tutorial</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command across two interwoven battlefields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Duality Swap to move units and objects between planes as a core tactic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Surround Consume to deal significant damage to surrounded enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a team through a large region with RPG progression and collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to gain their signature abilities as equippable Echoes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer Legacy Zones<strong> -</strong> tough boss areas at the edge of the map - using powerful Relics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Base Management feature coming soon!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check Out the Main Game for More</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776480/extras/Characters.jpg?t=1759963496\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776480?t=1759963496","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776480?t=1759963496","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776480/84ef2e41b0b28b1f5a2ea01f1641dfa2b8040aaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759963496","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776480/84ef2e41b0b28b1f5a2ea01f1641dfa2b8040aaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17